<title>USA: Gables Residential buys apartment complex.</title>
<headline>Gables Residential buys apartment complex.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gables Residential Trust said it has acquired an apartment complex in Atlanta for $28.9 million.</p>
<p>The 438-unit Wood Mill property was originally built by Gables in 1988 and sold to Prudential, but has been managed by Gables.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
